"A Submerger is an extremely rare magical device."
"It looks like an aquarium of yellow oil over clear water, a silver ball floating where they meet."
"Orpheus Velra traded a stolen Submerger to Jacob for drugs."
"Set on its crystal dial, it lets a boat sink deep and go silently and traceless past patrols."
"The one from Jacob was only the second Submerger Superhumans at Large ever obtained."
